{
  "name": "elder_ema50_force_canonical_v1",
  "description": "Canonical trader-slang Elder ('triple screen'): 4h EMA50 tide, 1h pullback wave, 15m/5m entry ripple. Built from the latest review: price vs EMA50 for trend, Force/Stoch/RSI pullback variants, 1h ATR stop around 0.75-1.25, and RR near 2.",
  "cache_only": true,
  "command": [
